---
// HowItWorksSection.astro - Three-step process explanation
---

<!-- How It Works Section -->
<section
  class="py-16 sm:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-white via-blue-50/20 to-white"
  data-aos="fade-up"
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-12 sm:mb-20">
      <h2
        class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-900"
        data-aos="fade-up"
      >
        Getting your MRI is this easy
      </h2>
      <p class="text-2xl text-gray-600" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
        From request to results in three simple steps
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 sm:gap-12 max-w-6xl mx-auto how-it-works-steps"
    >
      <!-- Step 1 -->
      <div
        class="text-center flex flex-col"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-delay="200"
      >
        <div
          class="relative h-48 sm:h-56 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 sm:mb-8"
        >
          <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2">
            <span
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gray-200 text-gray-600 text-sm font-semibold"
              >1</span
            >
          </div>
          <div
            class="w-40 h-40 bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center"
          >
            <img
              src="/images/icons/expenses.svg"
              alt="Compare prices"
              class="flex-shrink-0 w-24 h-24"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 min-h-[4rem]">
          Submit your imaging request
        </h3>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">
          Upload or confirm your physician's order and choose your preferred
          location.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 2 -->
      <div
        class="text-center flex flex-col"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-delay="300"
      >
        <div
          class="relative h-48 sm:h-56 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 sm:mb-8"
        >
          <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2">
            <span
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#003087] text-white text-sm font-semibold"
              >2</span
            >
          </div>
          <div
            class="w-40 h-40 bg-[#fefbf5] rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center"
          >
            <img
              src="/images/icons/appointment1.svg"
              alt="Book instantly"
              class="flex-shrink-0 w-24 h-24"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 min-h-[4rem]">
          We coordinate your appointment
        </h3>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">
          USRad verifies your order and schedules you with an accredited imaging
          center.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Step 3 -->
      <div
        class="text-center flex flex-col"
        data-aos="fade-up"
        data-aos-delay="400"
      >
        <div
          class="relative h-48 sm:h-56 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 sm:mb-8"
        >
          <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2">
            <span
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#cc9933] text-white text-sm font-semibold"
              >3</span
            >
          </div>
          <div
            class="w-40 h-40 bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center"
          >
            <img
              src="/images/icons/fast.svg"
              alt="Get results fast"
              class="flex-shrink-0 w-24 h-24"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 min-h-[4rem]">
          Receive your results
        </h3>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">
          Board-certified radiologists interpret your scan and your results are
          delivered quickly.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <style>
      @media (min-width: 768px) {
        .how-it-works-steps > div:not(:last-child)::after {
          content: "";
          position: absolute;
          top: 128px;
          right: -48px;
          width: 96px;
          height: 2px;
          background: linear-gradient(
            to right,
            #e5e7eb 0%,
            #e5e7eb 45%,
            transparent 45%,
            transparent 55%,
            #e5e7eb 55%,
            #e5e7eb 100%
          );
          background-size: 8px 2px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </div>
</section>
